{
  "_comment": [
    "Maintainer curation for the en-us seed (decision E1, FR-CONTENT-01).",
    "",
    "E1's validate stage exists to keep content changes reviewable before load.",
    "This file is where a review decision is RECORDED, as committed data rather",
    "than as an edit to fetched upstream content: the raw artifact stays a",
    "faithful copy of what Wiktionary served, and every departure from it is",
    "visible here and in version control.",
    "",
    "Three kinds of entry:",
    "  ipa      - pin the American transcriptions for a word whose upstream",
    "             accent tags do not narrow it to American English. Listed in",
    "             display order; the first becomes is_primary.",
    "  skip     - exclude a headword, with the reason.",
    "  pronunciations[<ipa>].syllableBreakdown - override a breakdown that the",
    "             upstream transcription left unsyllabified.",
    "",
    "Overrides are applied by the normalise stage in",
    "src/services/word-ingestion.service.js."
  ],
